# Signal2Image Modules in Deep Neural Networks for EEG Classification
xdg-open https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.13216
xdg-open https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8856620/

# Usage
xdg-open https://pbizopoulos.github.io/README.txt

# Local workflow
nix fmt
nix flake check
nix develop --command python packages/default/main.py

The experiment writes checkpoints, figures, results.tex, and ms.pdf to ./tmp/.
The flake check runs an offline, one-epoch AlexNet smoke experiment across all
five module variants and verifies the generated figures, results, and PDF.
Manuscript sources and the dataset are stored in packages/default/prm/.
